{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"636012145204527127","content":"There’s the actual coral, which is a heavily armored sponge, basically, and these lil plankton buddies, called zooanthellae, they can photosynthesize and make the energy for the coral! And the coral gives them a safe place to live!","created_at":"2020-08-07T19:15:54.958000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741374080930021498","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
