{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"636012145204527127","content":"How do the two find eachother? Are there just clusters of coral, like the coral reaf?","created_at":"2020-08-07T19:18:27.026000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741374718749310998","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"636012145204527127","content":"Gil gave a long description on how it works back on the boat","created_at":"2020-08-07T19:19:28.560000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741374976841613413","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"636012145204527127","content":"(coral)","created_at":"2020-08-07T19:19:36.519000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741375010224078908","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"636012145204527127","content":"So that’s the thing! Zooanthellae reproduce in the coral, and coral reproduces in a mix of cloning and “sexual” reproduction.","created_at":"2020-08-07T19:19:55.528000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741375089953472552","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
